{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7b1b6d3c-4b78-8b94-ae9f-c990015a64fb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T11:49:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gino Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:44:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:44:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I got a recycling bin that was left at the curb with a tag on it saying it was rejected. I need to know how to get a replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. So the bin was tagged as rejected, and you'd like a replacement. Can I get the address where the bin is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "9 Old Beach Road. Over by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:45:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "9 Old Beach Road, got it. And may I have your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:45:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gino Pellegrino."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:45:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Pellegrino. Do you remember what day the tag was left? Was it this morning's pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:45:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it was yesterday, Tuesday. I came home, bin was sitting there with the tag on it. Nobody dumped it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:45:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the crew skipped it yesterday and left the tag. Does the tag say a reason? Sometimes there's a box checked or a note written on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:46:05-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. [pause] Sorry, my screen reader is going in the background, it's reading something out loud. Let me turn that down. Okay. The tag, I got it here. It's got a checkbox, says contaminated, or something like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:46:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. So the tag says contaminated. That usually means something in the bin that doesn't belong, like plastic bags or food waste mixed in with the recyclables."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:46:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I figured. Look, I don't know that that's even my bin. Mine was cracked on the side, the lid's been loose since fall. That's why I want a replacement anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So two things, then. The bin is cracked and the lid is loose, and you want a new one. I'll put in a request for a replacement bin at 9 Old Beach Road. Is the bin the standard size, the one with the blue lid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:47:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the blue one. Standard, whatever the regular is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:47:22-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And I'll note that it was tagged on Tuesday so someone can look at it. Do you want it picked up again, or should you just clean out whatever was in there and put it out for the next collection?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:47:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll go through it. Probably some bags in there. I'll sort it and put it out next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:47:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Just keep out any loose bags and anything with food on it. Once it's sorted, set it out on your regular day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:48:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. How long for the new bin? Last time it took forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have an exact delivery day in front of me. Usually it's within a couple of weeks, and it's left at the curb. If you haven't seen it by then, call us back and we'll follow up on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:48:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you need a number for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:48:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, in case the crew has a question."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:48:40-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:48:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0157. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:48:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:48:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I have a replacement recycling bin for Gino Pellegrino at 9 Old Beach Road, cracked body and loose lid, tag left Tuesday for contamination. Anything else I should add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:49:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that covers it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:49:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Pellegrino. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:49:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
